{"id":4379,"date":"2025-04-16T00:37:23","date_gmt":"2025-04-16T00:37:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/?post_type=projects&#038;p=4379"},"modified":"2025-04-16T00:37:23","modified_gmt":"2025-04-16T00:37:23","slug":"rspca-cat-and-animal-centre","status":"publish","type":"projects","link":"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/project\/rspca-cat-and-animal-centre\/","title":{"rendered":"RSPCA Cat &amp; Small Animal Centre \u2013 Stages 1 &amp; 2"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate project-info\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"grid__details\"\">\n\n                \n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Location<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Pearcedale, Victoria<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Client<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"http:\/\/4dimensions.net.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4Dimensions Building Contractors<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Value<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>$3 MIL<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Timeframe<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>2021-2023<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Contractor<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"http:\/\/4dimensions.net.au\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4Dimensions Building Contractors<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Consultant team<\/h5>\n                            <p><p>Project Manager &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/curriebrown.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Currie &amp; Brown<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Structural &amp; Civil Engineer &#8211; Bruce Young Partners<br \/>\nBuilding Surveyor &#8211; <a href=\"http:\/\/codus.au\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Codus<\/a> (formerly PLP Building Surveyors &amp; Consultants)<\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                        <div>\n                            <h5>Photographer<\/h5>\n                            <p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.yelp.com\/biz\/christopher-alexander-photography-blackburn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Christopher Alexander Photography<\/a><\/p>\n<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                    \n                \n                \n                \n                                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__text\">\n                <p>Based on our lengthy experience in the animal welfare facility sector, Architecture Matters was engaged in 2021 by 4Dimensions Building Contractors to assist with the design and documentation of a new Cat &amp; Small Animal (CASA) facility of approximately 1200m2 at the existing RSPCA site at Pearcedale as part of a $3mil. design and construction project.<\/p>\n<p>The CASA aimed to enhance the organisation\u2019s capacity to care for around 200 cats and small number of small domestic animals and reduce the time they take to adopt, while transforming the way people meet and interact with animals available for adoption to increase adoption rates.<\/p>\n<p>Architecture Matters worked closely with 4Dimensions within a project management structure established by external project managers, Currie and Brown and were ultimately given leeway to work directly with RSPCA project management and operations staff through regular design meetings to ensure the resultant facility design reflected the detailed project brief and addressed some of the shortcomings identified with the original concept design.<\/p>\n<p>Through a detailed understanding and judicious application of the requirements of the <em>Code of Practice for the Management of Dogs and Cats in Shelters and Pounds<\/em> (2011), a rigorous analysis of workflows, OH&amp;S risks and RSPCA\u2019s priorities based on a strong emphasis on improved cat accommodation and management, the broad introduction of daylight and outlooks for cats, opportunities for cat enrichment and human contact, disease control via cat condo-style accommodation and dispersed food prep and cleaning, and structured visitor management, we were able to test multiple design options with project stakeholders to arrive at a preferred design and deliver the final, highly-functional built outcome.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4006.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"RSPCA Cat and Small Animal Adoption entrance\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4006.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4006-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4006-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4006-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate block-quote\">\n        <div class=\"max-sm:w-full ml-auto w-1\/2\">\n            <div>\n                <blockquote>\n\n                <p>The RSPCA Pearcedale facility is also notable for its light and calmness, a key objective of the client and delivering noticeable improvements in cat health and staff wellbeing.<\/p>\n\n                \n                <\/blockquote>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-thirds-image\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div>\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"855\" height=\"570\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4625.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"RSPCA Cat &amp; Small Animal Centre cat condos\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4625.jpg 855w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4625-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4625-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate two-columns-text-image\">\n        \n        \n                \n        <div class=\"grid mt-[30px] md:mt-[50px]\">\n            <div class=\"grid__text space-y-12\">\n                <div><p>Some important elements of the final design included delivering separate circulation paths for staff, public and animals and separate operational and mechanical services between animal accommodation and cleaning and food preparation zones, a consequence of which the incidence of transmission of infection across animal populations has been reduced.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"grid__image\">\n                 <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"620\" height=\"930\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4250.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"RSPCA Cat &amp; Small Animal Centre front entrance\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4250.jpg 620w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4250-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/>            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4270.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"RSPCA Cat &amp; Small Animal Centre view from reception area\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4270.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4270-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4270-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4270-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"block block-animate full-width-image\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4209.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"RSPCA Cat &amp; Small Animal Centre\" srcset=\"https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4209.jpg 1320w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4209-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4209-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/architecturematters.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/43A4209-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1320px) 100vw, 1320px\" \/>    <\/section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <section class=\"blo